"""One-load marker-bound Symbolic Oracle -> Qwen 3.8 Max canary.

This is explicitly a kinematic research diagnostic.  Both phases use the
same public action registry, plugin dispatcher, visual marker store, and
official SymbolicSemanticActionPrimitives backend.  Private object handles
are used only by the Oracle author and verifier; the model receives only
ordered onboard PNGs, the public instruction, and its own prior actions.
"""

